Cat sprite pack provenance

Author/origin: OpenAI image generation tool, requested by the Dropdown Terminal
maintainer on 2026-09-06. The sprite atlas and compact bar icon were generated
as original artwork for this repository; no third-party artwork was imported.

Modifications: pet.png was normalized to a 256x256 RGBA PNG (8 columns by 8
rows of 32x32 cells) with nearest-neighbor scaling and metadata stripped.
bar.png was derived from the first atlas frame, then normalized to a separate
20x20 RGBA PNG with nearest-neighbor scaling. The action/frame mapping and
contact anchors are authored in pet.json.

Prompt summary: original cute fluffy cream-and-orange tabby cat pixel-art sprite
atlas and compact bar icon, transparent background, limited palette, hard
integer-aligned edges, no text or watermark.

